# Prover pack: an unvalidated request value must not reach the event processor.
#
# The handler reads a header (a source) and passes the parsed body to the processor;
# the proof must show the header does not flow to the processor argument.
rule event-input
  kind taint
  severity error
  message An unvalidated request value reaches the event processor
  source Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.HttpRequest.get_Headers result
  source Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.HttpRequest.get_Query result
  sink Fixtures.Requests.IEventProcessor.ProcessAsync arg 0
end
